#: ../../chapter05.rst:3
msgid "5 Settings"
msgstr "5 Indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:5
msgid ""
"To access the Client Settings, click the Client Icon on the top-right of "
"your Mac Desktop. This will open the Cloud Settings Panel. Clicking the "
"**Console (1)** icon will open the \"Client Management Console\" window "
"where the user can configure additional settings. In the Console window, "
"click the drop-down menu **(2)** and choose **\"Settings\" (3)**."
msgstr "For at få adgang til klientindstillingerne skal du klikke på klientikonet øverst til højre på dit Mac-skrivebord. Dette vil åbne panelet for Cloud-indstillinger. Ved at klikke på **Konsol (1)** ikonet åbnes vinduet \"Klientstyringskonsollen\", hvor brugeren kan konfigurere yderligere indstillinger. I konsolvinduet skal du klikke på rullemenuen **(2)** og vælge **\"Indstillinger\" (3)**."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:9
msgid ""
"There are many settings in this panel. Here are some specifically for the"
" Mac Client."
msgstr "Der er mange indstillinger i dette panel. Her er nogle specifikt for Mac-klienten."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Start Mac client automatically** - When this option is checked the user"
" will be automatically authenticated to the cloud volume upon system "
"restarts."
msgstr "**Start Mac-klienten automatisk** - Når denne mulighed er markeret, vil brugeren automatisk blive godkendt til cloud-volumenet ved systemgenstarter."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Do not show Mac Client sync status pop up dialog** - There will be "
"times when users do not want to see the sync progress windows which can "
"be suppressed by selecting this opt ion."
msgstr "**Vis ikke pop op-dialogboksen for synkroniseringsstatus for Mac-klient** - Der vil være tidspunkter, hvor brugere ikke ønsker at se vinduerne for synkroniseringsfremskridt, hvilket kan undertrykkes ved at vælge denne mulighed."

#: ../../chapter05.rst:19
msgid "6 Third-Party Open Source Component"
msgstr "6 Tredjeparts Open Source-komponent"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:21
msgid "The Mac client agent has OSXFUSE component from https://github.com/osxfuse"
msgstr "Mac-klientagenten har OSXFUSE-komponent fra https://github.com/osxfuse"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:23
msgid "Please review the osxfuse license.txt here"
msgstr "Gennemgå venligst osxfuse licens.txt her"

#: ../../chapter05.rst:25
msgid "https://github.com/osxfuse/osxfuse/blob/master/LICENSE.txt"
msgstr "https://github.com/osxfuse/osxfuse/blob/master/LICENSE.txt"

